# --- Local-only project process artifacts ---
# Maintained throughout the project, updated at every stage, but never
# published to the public GitHub repository — internal planning, evidence,
# stage-by-stage build history, and agent-facing documentation stay on the
# local machine only.
.claude/
docs/*
# docs/reports/index.html is the one public exception: architecture and
# interaction diagrams plus the business-value argument, regenerated by
# `make report` — never a stage/build-progress log, never a list of files
# written or decisions made. Everything that fed it (task brief, plan
# amendments, decisions, uml sources, per-stage evidence) stays local.
!docs/reports
docs/reports/*
!docs/reports/index.html
AGENTS.md
AI_USAGE.md
BACKGROUND_MATERIALS.md
CLAUDE.md
handoff.md
insights.md
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

# --- Secrets and credentials ---
.env
.cache/
*.token.json

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Node / web ---
node_modules/
apps/web/dist/

# --- Notebook outputs: raw cart/session data can carry PII ---
# Ignore outputs, keep the notebook source itself tracked.
notebooks/.ipynb_checkpoints/
# stripped via nbstripout pre-commit once configured at G1; until then,
# outputs are cleared by hand before every commit that touches this file.

# --- Raw fixture captures: sanitized copies only reach the repo ---
datasets/fixtures/raw/

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
